# Third-party licenses

The platoon binary is built from these Rust crates, each under the license shown with it. This file lists every
crate built into the release binaries for Linux and macOS, with the license text it ships. It is generated by
[cargo-about](https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about) from `about.toml` and `about.hbs`; do not edit it by hand:
run `cargo about generate --frozen --fail about.hbs -o THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md` after a dependency changes.

The color themes and the built-in squads are credited in [THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md](THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).

